@startuml 07-document-analysis
!include style.iuml
title Analysis - from ZIP to a decision
start
:ZIP held in memory;
:List member names - nothing inflated yet;
if (Name passes the path-traversal guard?) then (no)
  :Surface in the failure log\nnever silently dropped;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (Name matches a TOR pattern\n(canonical or loose)?) then (yes)
  :Candidate;
elseif (Not a known boilerplate member?\n(bonds, contracts, forms, announcement)) then (yes)
  :Unlabelled candidate - at most 4;
else (no)
  :Ignored - never read;
  stop
endif
:Inflate only the chosen members;
if (PDF 15 MB or less?) then (yes)
  :Send the whole PDF as base64\nreadMode = pdf;
else (no - oversize)
  if (Text layer available?) then (yes)
    :Send text\nreadMode = text;
  elseif (First pages fit 14 MB?) then (yes)
    :Send first pages\nreadMode = first_pages;
  else (no)
    :Mark unreadable;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Gemini returns isTor, torKind,\nanalysis and software judgement;
:assignDocumentRoles picks ONE main TOR\nmarks variants, not-TOR, ambiguity;
:decideOutcome;
note right
  software + high + whole PDF -> tor_analysed
  software + low              -> needs_review
  not software + high + whole -> dropped + tombstone
  not software + low          -> needs_review
  partial read (text / pages) -> needs_review
end note
stop
@enduml
